{"id":"491135","name":"酱腌萝卜","author":"企茶点茶档","authorId":"11132809","desc":"","cover":"images/491135/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"大量"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白醋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"凉开水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"预备材料，清洗干净","img":"images/491135/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"萝卜切薄片，下2勺盐，腌1小时，腌出水，水倒掉","img":"images/491135/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"小米椒切圈，姜蒜切片","img":"images/491135/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"预备腌料，凉开水＋醋＋酱油，比例2：2：1，再加白糖，搅拌融化白糖","img":"images/491135/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒进腌出水后的萝卜片","img":"images/491135/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀，让萝卜都占上料","img":"images/491135/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再倒入其他配料","img":"images/491135/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"腌一个晚上","img":"images/491135/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成了，爽脆，香辣，味道还行。","img":"images/491135/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}